1016, "The Anhur is engaging its fusion drive, heading to the Alpha Centauri jump node.  Do not let it escape!"

1017, "An Isis transport and Taurus freighters have entered the Alpha Centauri jump node.  There go the prototypes and Vasudan VIPs!"

1018, "This mission is over.  Return to base."

1019, "The Anhur has escaped to Alpha Centauri.  Return to base."

1020, "This is Lieutenant Osun of the Anhur.  The rebels have engineering and bridge.  They also have the hostages and prototypes on transports to Alpha Centauri."

1021, "Imhotep here.  We are taking severe damage.  Request immediate support."

1022, "Confirmed.  Hostages and prototypes are on board the transports and out of intercept range.  Advising Alpha Centauri.  Alpha and Beta wings, you are now to engage and destroy the Anhur."

1023, "Delta wing is standing by.  Call in the bombers at your discretion, Alpha."

1024, "The Anhur has been destroyed."

1025, "Chasing the Threat"

1026, "Part 2 of the Templar Campaign.  Pursuing Hammer of Light transports containing hostages."

1027, "We arrived too late in Vasuda to prevent the $h HoL transport and freighters from escaping.  We are now pursuing them to Alpha Centauri.  The rebels demand the release of all $h HoL leaders in government custody in exchange for the safe return of the hostages.  The Vasudans have agreed to negotiate to give us time to attempt a rescue."

1028, "Vasudan intelligence believes the $h Hammer $h of $h Light has isolated Supreme Admiral Khu and is holding him on board the $h Isis transport.  The other hostages were transferred to two $h Taurus freighters.  The third $h Taurus contains the stealth technology prototypes."

1029, "Your mission is to scan all three freighters and destroy the vessel containing the prototypes.  Once you have completed this objective, stand by for further orders.  Under no circumstances should you fire on the ships carrying hostages."

1030, "The Taurus freighters are taking the hostages to Aldebaran, while Admiral Khu is being taken to Sirius.  Your orders are to follow the freighters.  Other assets will try to track Admiral Khu."

1031, "The Taurus freighters are taking the hostages to Aldebaran, while Admiral Khu is being taken to Sirius.  Your orders are to track Admiral Khu.  Other assets will try to follow the freighters."

1032, "You disobeyed a direct order, pilot.  Your reckless and criminal behavior has endangered the lives of our allies, jeopardizing future cooperation between Terrans and Vasudans.  You are confined to the brig pending a court-martial."

1033, "Only destroy the freighter carrying the prototypes, and only when you have identified which freighters carry the hostages."

