1042, "We're pulling out, pilots.  Provide cover for the PVC Wosyet."

1043, "Isis transport has jumped to Sirius."

1044, "Taurus wing has entered the Aldebaran jump node.  Hostages have cleared the system.  Engage and destroy all Hammer of Light vessels."

1045, "Sensors indicate HOL cruiser and three new freighters en route to Aldebaran jump node.  Destroy them, Alpha."

1046, "Hammer of Light cruiser Hathor destroyed."

1047, "Isis transport has been eliminated."

1048, "Hammer of Light confirmed in Aldebaran and Sirius.  Proceed to the nearest jump node and rendezvous with our forces in that system."

1049, "Destroy Taurus 3.  The stealth prototypes are on board."

1050, "Cease fire, Terrans.  We will kill the hostages if you do not withdraw."

1051, "Do NOT fire on the freighters.  Proceed to scan Taurus wing and locate the hostages."

1052, "All pilots, hold your fire.  Stay clear of Taurus 1 and 2.  Do not engage those freighters."

1053, "Wosyet here.  Sustaining heavy damage.  Request cover."

1054, "Cease fire immediately, pilot."

1055, "Do not engage the Hammer of Light vessels.  Repeat.  Do not engage."

1056, "You have your orders, pilot.  Stand down."

1057, "Your actions are endangering the hostages!"

1058, "You're jeopardizing this mission!  Return to base!"

1059, "Tightening the Noose"

1060, "Part 3 of the Templar Campaign.  Rescue Vasudan hostages and neutralize final Hammer of Light destroyer."

1061, "The $h Hammer $h of $h Light freighters carrying the Vasudan hostages seem to be headed for a rendezvous with the $h Tanis, an $h HoL destroyer.  The $h Tanis and the freighters are now in the Aldebaran system.  Command anticipates the rebels will try to transfer the hostages to the destroyer."

1062, "Your main task is to keep those freighters from docking with the $h Tanis.  We need to get the hostages back and we won't be able to if they get them onto that destroyer.  If you can prevent that rendezvous, we'll send in marines in troop transports to capture the freighters and rescue the hostages."

1063, "Do whatever is necessary to ensure the hostages' safety.  We don't know what other forces the $h HoL has in-system, but you must handle them.  Once the hostages are out of danger, wipe out the remaining $h HoL vessels."

1064, "We have been advised that our forces in the Sirius system are preparing to engage the last known $h Hammer $h of $h Light outpost.  A decisive victory in both systems will mean the complete annihilation of the $h Hammer $h of $h Light.  This is a historic moment, pilot.  Command is confident you are up to the challenge."

1065, "Because of your outstanding performance, the hostages were successfully recovered.  Operation Templar was a total success.  All loyal citizens of the GTVA are celebrating the eradication of the Hammer of Light.  Excellent work, pilots!"

1066, "Against difficult odds, GTVA marines boarded the HoL freighters and recovered the Vasudan hostages.  This rescue effort would not have succeeded without your efforts.  Well done, pilots."

1067, "The GTVA has issued a formal apology for our failure to rescue the hostages.  The Vasudans have little choice but to comply with the rebels' demands and release Hammer of Light prisoners in exchange for the officers.  Operation Templar was a total failure."

1068, "Disable the freighters with Akhetons or Stilettos.  If your wingmen can't seem to help, order them to cover you."

1069, "We botched the rescue mission, and the hostages paid with their lives.  The Vasudans have terminated Operation Templar and will deal with the Hammer of Light on their own.  There's a garbage scow with your name on it.  Dismissed."

1070, "Use Akhetons or Stilettos to disable the freighters without destroying them.  Keep a close eye on Zeta wing, and use your wingmen to draw fire from fighters and turrets."

