1084, "Zeta 3 here.  Taurus 2 is blocking access to the Tanis.  Request assistance."

1085, "We lost the hostages!  Fire at will, pilots.  Execute a clean sweep."

1086, "Mission over, pilots.  Return to base."

1087, "There were hostages on Taurus 1, pilot.  You are hereby relieved of duty.  Return to base immediately!"

1088, "You killed the hostages, pilot.  Return to base immediately!"

1089, "You violated a direct order, pilot.  The hostages were aboard the Tanis.  Return to base immediately!"

1090, "Primary objective failed.  Hostages down.  Execute a clean sweep, pilots.  Fire at will."

1091, "This is Vasudan Admiral Iman.  I have been instructed to inform you that a hostage will be executed every five Terran minutes if your forces do not withdraw."

1092, "Pilots, return to base."

1093, "Deploying Zeta 1."

1094, "Deploying Zeta 2."

1095, "Surviving hostages are now clear.  Fighters, sweep the area clean.  Fire at will."

1096, "Zeta 1 is now clear.  We lost Zeta 2.  Pilots, fire at will."

1097, "Hostages now aboard the Tanis.  Deploying Zeta 3."

1098, "Zeta 1 and Zeta 2 have cleared the system."

1099, "Acknowledged, Zeta 3.  Pilots, clear that docking point!  Destroy Taurus 2.  Repeat.  Destroy Taurus 2."

1100, "Zeta 2 is now clear.  We lost Zeta 1.  Pilots, fire at will."

1101, "Sweep the area clean, pilots.  Fire at will."

1102, "You must stop the freighters from docking with the Tanis, pilots.  Take out their engines, but do it without killing the hostages!"

1103, "Zeta 1 here.  Hostages being transferred."

1104, "Zeta 2 here.  Hostages being transferred."

1105, "Make sure those hostages survive to jump out, pilots!"

1106, "Final Outpost"

1107, "Conclusion to the Templar Campaign.  Rescue a Vasudan VIP and destroy the last Hammer of Light stronghold."

1108, "Welcome to Sirius, pilots.  Vasudan forces have tracked the $h Isis transport to the remote $h Nagada outpost here.  This installation was de-commissioned after the Great War, but the $h Hammer $h of $h Light has brought the facility back on-line.  Intelligence suspects they have been operating in this sector for only a short time."

1109, "The Vasudans are deploying a hostage rescue team to invade the $h Nagada outpost, neutralize the rebels, and extract Supreme Admiral Khu.  Your mission is to provide cover for the rescue team's transports.  Success in this endeavor is of the utmost importance."

1110, "With our victory in Aldebaran, this is the last remaining stronghold of the $h Hammer $h of $h Light.  A decisive victory here will mean the complete annihilation of the $h HoL.  We believe you are the team to accomplish this historic task.  Good luck, pilots!"

1111, "We rescued Supreme Admiral Khu and destroyed outpost Nagada, the last refuge of the Hammer of Light.  The GTVA has declared Operation Templar a complete success.  Excellent work, pilots!"

1112, "Allied Command has formally apologized to the Vasudan Emperor for our failure to rescue Supreme Admiral Khu.  The Vasudans are left with little choice but to comply with the rebels' demands and release Hammer of Light prisoners in exchange for the admiral.  Operation Templar has failed."

1113, "Clear out the outpost's defenses around the docking port before calling in the rescue team."

1114, "Though the Hammer of Light's outpost was destroyed, we lost Supreme Admiral Khu.  The GTVA has issued a formal apology for this failure.  Future cooperative efforts with our Vasudan allies have been jeopardized."

1115, "Guard the transport with the Admiral, and don't destroy the station until he is safe."

1116, "After two attempts, we managed to rescue Supreme Admiral Khu.  Unfortunately, outpost Nagada remains operational.  We are deploying a strike force to eliminate the hostiles you failed to neutralize."

1117, "Protect your bombers."

1118, "Operation Templar has been declared a total failure.  The Hammer of Light's outpost remains operational, and Supreme Admiral Khu was killed during the rescue attempt.  The Vasudans have decided to resolve the situation without Terran involvement.  You are grounded pending reassignment."

1119, "Don't summon the Impunity until you've cleared a path to the station.  Then, guard the transport with the Admiral."

