1131, "GTT Liberty.  Docking point cleared.  Admiral Khu on board."

1132, "Admiral Khu is dead!  Pilots, destroy all Hammer of Light vessels!"

1133, "Rescue failed.  Abort mission and return to base."

1134, "Eliminate all hostiles remaining.  Secure the area and return to base."

1135, "Stand clear of outpost Nagada!  Sensors reading a massive energy surge!"

1136, "Admiral Khu is safe and sound.  Sweep this sector clear of HoL ships."

1137, "Admiral Khu is on outpost Nagada.  Deploying transports now.  Pilots, clear a path for the transports.  GTC Impunity standing by."

1138, "Hammer of Light transports escaping outpost Nagada.  Intercept and destroy."

1139, "GTC Impunity still standing by.  Call it in when you're ready."

1140, "This is the GVT Keb. We are now in position. Commencing docking sequence."

1141, "Operation Templar, a Galactic Terran-Vasudan Alliance endeavor, hunts down the last remnants of the Hammer of Light.  The rebels stage a desperate last stand, hijacking a Vasudan destroyer and taking hostages."

1142, "Important records have been unearthed on Altair IV.  However, getting there and back might be far more difficult than anyone ever imagined."

1143, "Convoy Assault"

1144, "The players must lead a Terran assault on a Vasudan convoy.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 4."

1145, "A Hammer of Light convoy is heading towards the Beta Aquilae jump node.  We must cut off all points of travel for the Hammer of Light.  Destroy the convoy."

1146, "Great job, you were able to destroy the entire convoy.  This is a major victory for our forces."

1147, "While you were unsuccessful in destroying the entire convoy, you did manage to get a good number of them.  That should cripple Vasudan forces for a short while."

1148, "Your failure to destroy the convoy has us all worried.  There is a good chance that the Vasudans will have enough supplies to prolong this battle for another few months."

1149, "Destroy the Convoy"

1150, "Leviathan Duel"

1151, "Two cruisers engage each other, with only their fighter complements to assist them.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 5.  Recommended respawns 3."

1152, "Your orders are to defend the $f Arcticon from the attacking force of the $h Zaldhun.  Destroy $h Zeta wing and protect the Arcticon.  Your secondary objective is to destroy the Zaldhun.
$f Omicron will assist you be guarding the Arcticon."

1153, "If things get out of hand, and the Arcticon is in danger, she will attempt to retreat.  Do not allow the Arcticon to be destroyed."

1154, "Your orders are to defend the $f Zaldhun from the attacking force of the $h Arcticon.  Destroy $h Alpha wing and protect the Zaldhun.  Your secondary objective is to destroy the Arcticon.
$f Omicron will assist you be guarding the Zaldhun."

1155, "If things get out of hand, and the Zaldhun is in danger, she will attempt to retreat.  Do not allow the Zaldhun to be destroyed."

1156, "Good job.  We were able to gain a foothold on this sector by your outstanding performance.  The Zaldhun and her forces have been defeated.  This is a major victory for our cause."

1157, "We were unable to gain a foothold on this sector of space.  You failed to defeat the enemy, and this will cost us dearly in the long run.  The forces of the Zaldhun have won this battle."

1158, "You should choose either an offensive or defensive strategy.  Make sure you load out your ships correctly, and always watch enemy bombers: they can make short work of your cruiser."

1159, "That you were able to destroy the Zaldhun instead of just injuring her is even more outstanding.  You are to be commended for your attention to detail."

1160, "That the Arcticon was actually destroyed makes this loss even worse.  There is almost no way that we can recapture this sector without her."

1161, "When your cruiser goes below 10% hull, it will attempt to warp out.  It would be a good idea to make sure it doesn't get hit for the next 30 seconds or so, and your cruiser will be able to survive."

1162, "This battle was indecisive.  Neither us nor the Zaldhun were able to gain any kind of advantage.  We must double our efforts."

1163, "Don't let them take out your cruiser while you attack theirs.  You must find a balance between offense and defense."

1164, "Good job.  We were able to gain a foothold on this sector by your outstanding performance.  The Arcticon and her forces have been defeated.  This is a major victory for our forces."

1165, "We were unable to gain a foothold on this sector of space.  You failed to defeat the enemy, and this will cost us dearly in the long run.  The forces of the Arcticon have won this battle."

1166, "That you were able to destroy the Arcticon instead of just injuring her is even more outstanding.  You are to be commended for your attention to detail."

1167, "That the Zaldhun was actually destroyed makes this loss even worse.  There is almost no way that we can recapture this sector without her."

1168, "This battle was indecisive.  Neither us nor the Arcticon were able to gain any kind of advantage.  We must double our efforts."

