2779, "Escort Iota through an asteroid field to a secret GTI safe spot.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

2780, "Protect the GTD Krios from an opposing Shivan force.  Multiplayer mission.  Max respawns 10.  Recommended respawns 5."

