3903, "In this combat simulation, you will engage 11 other Allied pilots in a dogfight.  Your objective is to achieve as many kills as possible during the mission.  This exercise will end when the time limit is reached or at the host's discretion.  The simulator will then display scores for each player.  AI kills do not count toward your final score."

